摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"AI-powered personal news aggregator with LLM scoring, Web console, and push notifications to Feishu/Discord.","id":"gh:1277694349","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"news-agent","slug":"huawolf/news-agent","topics":["dsh-plugin","news-aggregator","news-worker","rss-reader","vaneworker"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"AI-powered personal news aggregator with LLM scoring, Web console, and push notifications to Feishu/"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ed personal news aggregator with LLM scoring, Web console, and push notifications to Feishu/Discord."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# News Agent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"News Agent is a local, personal news service. It collects RSS feeds, Hacker News, and built-in signa"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"l sources into one scored news pool, adds a GitHub Trending digest, and uses an OpenAI-compatible LL"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"M to rank, summarize, and deliver to Feishu or Discord."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"It runs on macOS, Windows, and Linux. A local web console, HTTP API, and stdio MCP server all manage"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" the same configuration and jobs."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Aggregate RSS feeds, Hacker News, Product Hunt, Reddit, App Store new apps, V2EX, 36Kr, Sspai, OSC"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"hina, Jike topics, and other built-in sources into one news pool, with GitHub Trending generated alo"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ngside it.\n- Rank, filter, deduplicate, and summarize content with an LLM.\n- Add, update, verify, an"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"d remove RSS sources from the web console, API, or MCP.\n- Set interests, exclusions, source weights,"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" delivery times, and item limits.\n- Run scheduled fetches and deliveries, or trigger them manually.\n"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"- Deliver to Feishu, Discord, or a custom HTTP endpoint.\n- Keep configuration, logs, and job history"},{"id":"p6s7","text":" in the local user-data directory.\n- Bind the local control plane to `127.0.0.1:12301` by default."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- macOS, Windows, or Linux\n- uv\n- An API key for an OpenAI Chat, OpenAI Responses, or Anthropic Mess"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ows, or Linux\n- uv\n- An API key for an OpenAI Chat, OpenAI Responses, or Anthropic Messages endpoint"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The installer scripts for macOS, Linux, and Windows will automatically install `uv` for the current "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"user if it is not already available."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"You can install News Agent using a single terminal command without cloning first:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"macOS or Linux:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Windows PowerShell:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The installer creates `.env` from `.env.example`, installs the locked runtime dependencies, register"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"s a per-user login service, and restarts that service so repeated installs immediately run the updat"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ed code. Open <http://127.0.0.1:12301> after installation."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Default Client Mode"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Regular users run in `client` mode by default. The shared server fetches and\nscores the common sourc"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e catalog once; each client pulls the last 24 hours of\nprocessed entries scoring at least 60 plus th"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"e latest successful GitHub digest, adds and scores only\nits private custom RSS feeds, then uses its "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"own preferences, schedule, language,\nitem limit, LLM, and delivery channel to select, summarize, and"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"schedule, language,\nitem limit, LLM, and delivery channel to select, summarize, and send the digest."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The default connection is:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`processednews` is the shared-news API value and does not protect the local\nconfiguration page. `NEW"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"S_AGENT_LOCAL_TOKEN` is a separate, optional private\npassword used only by the local Web/configurati"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"on API. Never replace one with\nthe other."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The local page reads `/api/news-sources` under the optional local-control rule.\nRemote clients read "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"`/api/server/sources` with `processednews`; these are\nseparate endpoints so an unset `NEWS_AGENT_LOC"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"AL_TOKEN` never causes the local\npage to request shared-news authentication."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Operators running the shared service use `mix` mode. Mix mode performs the\nserver fetch/scoring work"},{"id":"p24s2","text":", retains a rolling 24-hour in-memory cache, exposes\nthe shared-news endpoints, and can also run its"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" own delivery workflow. Manual\nand scheduled runs both process the full enabled source set and GitHu"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"b; delivery\nschedules control only time and final news count.\nConfigurations without `mode_settings`"},{"id":"p24s5","text":" receive the same regular-user `client`\ndefaults. Set `standalone` or `mix` explicitly only for self"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"regular-user `client`\ndefaults. Set `standalone` or `mix` explicitly only for self-hosted operation."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Configure the model, endpoint, protocol, API key, and delivery webhooks in the\n**Model and delivery "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"settings** section of the local web console. The fields\nsave automatically and the model connection "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"can be tested in place. Keep the\nconsole private because it displays configured secret values."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Secrets are stored in `.env`. Model settings, preferences, and delivery\nschedules are stored in `con"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"fig.json` through the validated local API. The LLM\nkey variable in `.env` must match `llm.apiKeyName"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"`; the default configuration\nuses `OPENAI_API_KEY`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Run"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Use `uv run news-agent` for all commands:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The `serve` command starts the built-in scheduler and the local API at <http://127.0.0.1:12301>. Int"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"eractive API documentation is available at <http://127.0.0.1:12301/docs>."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"A shared mix server must listen on an interface reachable by its clients, for\nexample:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Before exposing a mix server, set a private `NEWS_AGENT_LOCAL_TOKEN` for its\nmanagement API. Clients"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" still use `processednews` only for shared-news reads."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"To remove the login service without deleting data:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"On Windows:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Local API and MCP"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"The local API supports configuration, source, delivery, job, and log operations.\nSet `NEWS_AGENT_LOC"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"AL_TOKEN` in `.env` to protect these local management\nrequests. It is not the shared server value `p"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"rocessednews` and is never used\nfor client-to-server news retrieval."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The MCP server is intended for a local agent process:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Available MCP tools include source management, preference and schedule updates, manual fetch/push jo"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"bs, digest previews, job status, and recent logs. `run_push` requires explicit confirmation."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"AI agents performing installation or initial configuration should follow the\nNews Agent Operator ski"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"ll. It defines the\nnon-browser workflow for secret handling, API configuration, service restart,\nhea"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"lth checks, model testing, previews, and confirmed delivery."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"News Agent binds to loopback by default. Regular clients should keep that\ndefault. A mix server may "},{"id":"p47s2","text":"expose port `12301` for shared-news clients; protect\nits local management routes with `NEWS_AGENT_LO"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"CAL_TOKEN` and restrict network\naccess where practical. The public `processednews` value is not a ma"},{"id":"p47s4","text":"nagement\npassword. Keep `.env`, webhook URLs, and API keys out of version control."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
